{"url": "（本地文件）012、第十二节  熟悉分类概念，能描述事物间的关联.mp4", "link": false, "lang": "zh", "local_path": "G:\\【瑞杰老师】全能英语课程\\瑞杰老师 30 天英语实战训练营(1)\\012、第十二节  熟悉分类概念，能描述事物间的关联.mp4", "segments": [{"start": 12.41, "text": "This is the twelfth lesson of our twelfth.", "end": 16.11}, {"start": 16.11, "text": "我们刚学的上一节十一节课刚学到的第十一节课刚学的数字。", "end": 20.71}, {"start": 20.71, "text": "This is the twelfth lesson in our 30 day training camp by teacher Eric。", "end": 29.87}, {"start": 29.87, "text": "很高兴能跟着大家一起走到第十二节课。", "end": 33.37}, {"start": 33.37, "text": "上一节课我们学了基本的一到十的数字,以及怎么去表达时间。", "end": 38.47}, {"start": 38.47, "text": "记得这个词吗?TIME time。", "end": 40.77}, {"start": 40.77, "text": "Now, we're going to look further into some words and group them.", "end": 46.47}, {"start": 46.47, "text": "我们今天要干嘛?去做一些简单的名词也好,什么词也好的分类,去找一些总括性的概念。", "end": 54.37}, {"start": 54.37, "text": "等一下你们就知道了。", "end": 56.83}, {"start": 56.83, "text": "So follow me into this new journey,享受我们在一起聊英语的这个时光,不要背不要记,不要去折磨自己。", "end": 64.73}, {"start": 64.73, "text": "享受每一瞬间敞开你的这个心灵,这样你的学习效果也是最好的。", "end": 70.53}, {"start": 70.53, "text": "放心吧,所有我们学过的,你不确定的,不熟悉的,或者稍微遗忘的东西,它都会反复再出现。", "end": 77.43}, {"start": 77.43, "text": "So let's go.", "end": 78.73}, {"start": 78.73, "text": "Question,我们第十二节课是以问题展开的。", "end": 82.83}, {"start": 82.83, "text": "What are things?注意这个thing是有复数的things,所以它说are。", "end": 90.14}, {"start": 90.14, "text": "如果只有一个thing,那就什么?What is this?", "end": 93.44}, {"start": 93.44, "text": "What are things?", "end": 95.14}, {"start": 95.14, "text": "What is a thing?", "end": 96.74}, {"start": 96.74, "text": "What are things?对吧?", "end": 98.84}, {"start": 99.04, "text": "What are things?", "end": 100.44}, {"start": 100.44, "text": "things是什么东西呢?", "end": 102.44}, {"start": 102.44, "text": "我们这里就对thing这个词做一个真实的定义,真正的定义是这样的,感受一下。", "end": 107.84}, {"start": 107.84, "text": "A house,一个房子。", "end": 110.44}, {"start": 110.44, "text": "A house is a thing,所以我们知道thing包含房子。", "end": 116.31}, {"start": 116.31, "text": "Houses are things,很多房子就是很多thing。", "end": 120.93}, {"start": 120.93, "text": "Houses are things,注意英语的复数尾巴会带一个s。", "end": 126.83}, {"start": 126.83, "text": "Houses are things.", "end": 128.43}, {"start": 128.43, "text": "A hat, a hat is a thing.", "end": 131.99}, {"start": 131.99, "text": "Hats are things.", "end": 134.95}, {"start": 134.95, "text": "So a house is a thing, a hat is a thing.", "end": 137.55}, {"start": 137.55, "text": "我们知道thing既包含hat,也包含房子了。", "end": 142.05}, {"start": 142.05, "text": "Doors, a door.", "end": 146.64}, {"start": 146.64, "text": "And, and what?", "end": 149.47}, {"start": 149.47, "text": "And windows, windows.", "end": 154.65}, {"start": 154.65, "text": "Doors and windows are things.", "end": 157.65}, {"start": 157.65, "text": "门啊跟窗啊也是什么things。", "end": 162.28}, {"start": 162.28, "text": "Tables.", "end": 163.88}, {"start": 163.88, "text": "Tables and seats.", "end": 166.87}, {"start": 166.87, "text": "Tables and seats are things too.", "end": 172.88}, {"start": 172.88, "text": "Houses are things, hats are things.", "end": 175.08}, {"start": 175.08, "text": "Tables and chairs are things.", "end": 177.58}, {"start": 177.58, "text": "Doors and windows are things.", "end": 180.64}, {"start": 180.64, "text": "英语还有everything,所有的东西。", "end": 184.04}, {"start": 184.04, "text": "所以我们知道thing囊括了所有的什么事物,都可以叫things。", "end": 191.44}, {"start": 191.44, "text": "包不包含活人,我们还不知道。", "end": 193.74}, {"start": 193.74, "text": "但我们知道thing包含大部分的客观存在的事物。", "end": 198.24}, {"start": 198.24, "text": "That's all we know。", "end": 199.04}, {"start": 199.04, "text": "我们通过真实的这个概念形成来感受。", "end": 203.8}, {"start": 203.8, "text": "那回到第一节课的东西,还记得吗?", "end": 206.9}, {"start": 206.9, "text": "我们前面十节第一节课讲什么?", "end": 209.1}, {"start": 209.1, "text": "基础的代词。", "end": 210.7}, {"start": 210.7, "text": "What is this?", "end": 212.72}, {"start": 212.72, "text": "This is a man.", "end": 214.51}, {"start": 214.51, "text": "What is this?", "end": 216.3}, {"start": 216.3, "text": "This is a woman.", "end": 217.8}, {"start": 217.8, "text": "What is this?", "end": 219.3}, {"start": 219.3, "text": "This is a boy.", "end": 221.1}, {"start": 221.1, "text": "What is this?", "end": 221.9}, {"start": 221.9, "text": "This is a girl.", "end": 223.5}, {"start": 223.5, "text": "那我们现在又引入一个新概念。", "end": 225.8}, {"start": 225.8, "text": "Men and women.", "end": 228.88}, {"start": 228.88, "text": "This is a man.", "end": 229.98}, {"start": 229.98, "text": "This is a woman.", "end": 231.18}, {"start": 231.18, "text": "好多的man叫什么?", "end": 232.68}, {"start": 232.68, "text": "Men.", "end": 233.48}, {"start": 233.48, "text": "好多的woman叫什么?", "end": 235.18}, {"start": 235.18, "text": "Women.", "end": 236.18}, {"start": 236.18, "text": "Right?", "end": 236.68}, {"start": 236.68, "text": "A会变成E。", "end": 238.08}, {"start": 238.08, "text": "So men and women and boys and girls.", "end": 242.18}, {"start": 242.18, "text": "Boy和girl的复数加个S就好了。", "end": 244.88}, {"start": 244.88, "text": "Men和women会把A改成E。", "end": 247.48}, {"start": 247.48, "text": "这个又回到古英语,这个词是怎么来的?", "end": 250.88}, {"start": 250.88, "text": "比较后来的,就会统一用一个规则。", "end": 253.78}, {"start": 253.78, "text": "比较早期的,就会沿用他本来的表述方式。", "end": 259.62}, {"start": 259.62, "text": "所以会看到复数形态的区分。", "end": 262.62}, {"start": 262.62, "text": "这个大家记得他是有文化背景的。", "end": 265.22}, {"start": 265.22, "text": "Men and women and girls and boys are not things.", "end": 270.22}, {"start": 270.22, "text": "他这里明确说了,人不是一个thing,对吧?", "end": 274.62}, {"start": 274.62, "text": "可能只有死的东西,物体是thing。", "end": 278.45}, {"start": 278.45, "text": "They are persons.", "end": 282.34}, {"start": 282.34, "text": "这里为什么叫persons而不说people?", "end": 285.84}, {"start": 285.84, "text": "其实在当代英语里面,我们表达很多的人的时候,往往都用people。", "end": 292.74}, {"start": 292.74, "text": "但是在经典英语里面,person跟persons也是可以去区分使用的。", "end": 299.54}, {"start": 299.54, "text": "So a man is a person, many men are persons。", "end": 304.64}, {"start": 304.64, "text": "这个说法也完全是可以的。", "end": 307.24}, {"start": 307.24, "text": "这个我以后会专项的去讲,不再次展开。", "end": 310.54}, {"start": 310.54, "text": "你就记得persons的复数也完全是可以说的。", "end": 314.34}, {"start": 318.54, "text": "所以这里我们学习了两个总括性的概念。", "end": 321.74}, {"start": 321.74, "text": "概念这个词本来就是总括的。", "end": 324.34}, {"start": 324.34, "text": "这种鸟,那种鸟,这种鸟,那种鸟,都叫鸟。", "end": 327.74}, {"start": 327.74, "text": "鸟这个词就是概括出来的。", "end": 330.14}, {"start": 330.14, "text": "这就叫什么概念concept。", "end": 335.13}, {"start": 335.13, "text": "So today we have two new concepts,是什么?", "end": 338.93}, {"start": 338.93, "text": "Things and people,或者persons。", "end": 342.33}, {"start": 342.33, "text": "那我们现在要使用一下,它直接带入到实境里来了。", "end": 346.83}, {"start": 353.83, "text": "我们站在外面说,所以是有一定距离的,我们讲there。", "end": 357.83}, {"start": 357.83, "text": "你当然可以说什么here。", "end": 361.05}, {"start": 364.05, "text": "在房间里,所以是in the room。", "end": 367.05}, {"start": 370.55, "text": "是不是一群的时候我们说they这个代词,记得吧。", "end": 375.55}, {"start": 375.55, "text": "They are,不是is,有好几个,所以是are。", "end": 379.55}, {"start": 388.44, "text": "这女孩有个打算啦,所以是什么?", "end": 390.94}, {"start": 390.94, "text": "Will go,从a到b用什么介词?", "end": 394.44}, {"start": 403.75, "text": "所以这里有一个打算去窗的意思。", "end": 406.25}, {"start": 406.25, "text": "她可能要找那个男孩,或者男孩叫她过来看外面。", "end": 410.25}, {"start": 419.04, "text": "现在的be是is,以前的be是was,原型是be。", "end": 424.1}, {"start": 424.1, "text": "那未来的事我们都讲原型,因为既非此刻,也非过去。", "end": 429.1}, {"start": 435.66, "text": "在窗户那里。", "end": 437.66}, {"start": 444.38, "text": "记得him吧,复习一下。", "end": 446.38}, {"start": 448.9, "text": "是什么?是对象的代词。", "end": 451.9}, {"start": 451.9, "text": "如果男生是主体,那就是he。", "end": 454.9}, {"start": 454.9, "text": "如果男生是客体,他就是him。", "end": 458.34}, {"start": 458.34, "text": "所以这里因为女生是主体,她要去做这件事情。", "end": 462.34}, {"start": 462.34, "text": "情境里男的就变成什么?男孩就变成客体。", "end": 466.34}, {"start": 467.24, "text": "如果是反过来怎么讲,你们可以试一下,给你们两秒钟。", "end": 476.56}, {"start": 480.56, "text": "是不是同一个意思。", "end": 482.56}, {"start": 482.56, "text": "但是主客体变了,反过来了。", "end": 485.56}, {"start": 485.56, "text": "记住跟着teacher Eric走。", "end": 487.56}, {"start": 487.56, "text": "你会发现前面十几节的东西反反复复的在整合和出现,你大脑在反反复复的巩固和运用。", "end": 494.56}, {"start": 494.56, "text": "这就对了,我们不要背诵。", "end": 497.56}, {"start": 498.46, "text": "这里特指这个女生,世界上有很多girl。", "end": 501.46}, {"start": 505.46, "text": "记不记得in这个声音是什么意思啊?", "end": 508.46}, {"start": 508.46, "text": "如果把go拉长就是going,对吧?", "end": 511.46}, {"start": 511.46, "text": "一般来讲is going就是什么?", "end": 514.46}, {"start": 514.46, "text": "此刻正在就是is,过去在是was,正在就是is,is going to。", "end": 523.46}, {"start": 523.46, "text": "说明他正在持续做go这个动作。", "end": 526.46}, {"start": 527.36, "text": "这就是我们常说的,现在进行时。", "end": 530.36}, {"start": 531.36, "text": "你可以看到女生的姿势是这样的。", "end": 535.3}, {"start": 534.8, "text": "She is going to the window. Where was she? Was 之前的is 过去的is. Where was she? She was at the door. 非常好。", "end": 547.8}, {"start": 548.3, "text": "在座很多人肯定都答对了。", "end": 550.3}, {"start": 550.3, "text": "我觉得你们到现在的水准已经能够区分好这些,", "end": 553.3}, {"start": 554.2, "text": "大概是前十节中段中后段的一些概念,包括时态。", "end": 558.2}, {"start": 558.2, "text": "你看这是不是非常好的在运用。", "end": 561.2}, {"start": 562.2, "text": "他已经到窗户了,所以去这件事,go这个动作变成什么?", "end": 567.92}, {"start": 567.92, "text": "过去啦。", "end": 568.92}, {"start": 568.42, "text": "注意此刻。", "end": 570.42}, {"start": 581.58, "text": "注意,此刻都叫now。", "end": 583.58}, {"start": 587.53, "text": "已经坐了。", "end": 588.53}, {"start": 588.03, "text": "已经坐了。", "end": 589.31}, {"start": 602.44, "text": "有没有发现一个很有意思的事情啊?", "end": 605.44}, {"start": 605.44, "text": "你们已经在阅读啦,有没有发现这是一个故事啦?", "end": 610.44}, {"start": 610.44, "text": "所以很多邻居人说什么我阅读的时候看不懂像看天文,", "end": 614.87}, {"start": 614.87, "text": "是不是开始没有那个感觉啦?", "end": 616.87}, {"start": 617.77, "text": "Good for you。", "end": 618.77}, {"start": 618.77, "text": "如果你不是邻居的,你是考生,这是一次非常好的巩固机会。", "end": 623.77}, {"start": 624.77, "text": "你在描述一件事情的时候要记住,", "end": 627.77}, {"start": 627.77, "text": "清清楚楚,干干净净,", "end": 630.77}, {"start": 630.77, "text": "不要带任何这类的错误去你考试中的作文里面去。", "end": 635.77}, {"start": 635.77, "text": "很多人最基本的错误都在犯,", "end": 637.77}, {"start": 637.77, "text": "我们这一次之后就要梳理一下啦。", "end": 640.77}, {"start": 641.67, "text": "They are at the window, together。", "end": 646.67}, {"start": 646.67, "text": "这里多了一个什么,together。", "end": 648.67}, {"start": 648.67, "text": "当两个人在一起,这个状态的英语就是什么?", "end": 651.67}, {"start": 655.67, "text": "在窗户这个地方at,at the window together。", "end": 659.67}, {"start": 666.67, "text": "这句自己讲一遍。", "end": 668.67}, {"start": 671.67, "text": "是不是主课题在反向变化的时候要注意这个啊?", "end": 675.67}, {"start": 675.67, "text": "不要说he is with she, her is with him,", "end": 678.67}, {"start": 678.67, "text": "这种奇奇怪怪的,很多人会犯这种错误。", "end": 681.67}, {"start": 687.67, "text": "来,这里换一个对象。", "end": 689.67}, {"start": 698.67, "text": "架子怎么说?", "end": 699.67}, {"start": 701.67, "text": "知道就好了。", "end": 702.67}, {"start": 703.67, "text": "那怎么发音?", "end": 704.67}, {"start": 708.42, "text": "连着什么?", "end": 709.42}, {"start": 711.24, "text": "这就叫好的发音,不要去整口音,把发音搞清楚。", "end": 715.24}, {"start": 715.24, "text": "你的拼写自然就上岸了。", "end": 717.24}, {"start": 716.74, "text": "这段话词比较有意思。", "end": 718.74}, {"start": 733.24, "text": "这段话是不是有一些新的概念出来了?", "end": 735.24}, {"start": 738.24, "text": "together我们刚学过啦,男孩女孩在一起。", "end": 741.24}, {"start": 747.24, "text": "在架子上吗?", "end": 748.24}, {"start": 752.96, "text": "他们在架子上,他们不在一起。", "end": 756.62}, {"start": 756.62, "text": "那这里逻辑上发生了一个什么?", "end": 758.62}, {"start": 758.62, "text": "颠倒转折,对吧,中文叫转折。", "end": 761.62}, {"start": 762.52, "text": "本质上是什么?颠倒。", "end": 765.33}, {"start": 765.33, "text": "前面是肯定,后面是否定。", "end": 767.33}, {"start": 767.33, "text": "那这种时候怎么去让听的人知道说这里发生了一个跳转,", "end": 773.33}, {"start": 773.33, "text": "避免他误解,就要放一个连接词。", "end": 777.15}, {"start": 780.15, "text": "but怎么理解?看我表情。", "end": 782.15}, {"start": 786.15, "text": "你看我这个but的表情,就能感受到他的意思啦。", "end": 790.15}, {"start": 790.15, "text": "也是常用的英语词啦。", "end": 792.15}, {"start": 793.05, "text": "我经常在平时的直播里面会提到戒词。", "end": 797.05}, {"start": 797.05, "text": "戒词越来越多的出现了。", "end": 799.05}, {"start": 799.05, "text": "我们刚刚说at the window, on the wall, on the shelf,", "end": 802.05}, {"start": 802.05, "text": "对吧,at in, on,已经是我们最近接触过的前三个了。", "end": 806.05}, {"start": 806.05, "text": "那这里又冒出了一个什么?包括相片。", "end": 809.05}, {"start": 813.05, "text": "这里发生了一个from,那怎么理解呢?", "end": 816.48}, {"start": 823.48, "text": "显然他们要go了,说什么?离开。", "end": 826.48}, {"start": 826.48, "text": "那既然是从窗那里离开,这种离开一个事物,英语就是from。", "end": 833.1}, {"start": 832.6, "text": "The girl and the boy will go from the window.", "end": 836.88}, {"start": 836.88, "text": "Where are they going? I don't know. Let's see.", "end": 839.18}, {"start": 839.18, "text": "Oh, they are going from the window.", "end": 842.88}, {"start": 842.88, "text": "They were at the window.", "end": 845.14}, {"start": 845.14, "text": "Are they at the window?", "end": 847.34}, {"start": 847.34, "text": "No.", "end": 848.48}, {"start": 848.54, "text": "因为他们已经在going了。", "end": 850.54}, {"start": 850.54, "text": "他们已经不在那了。", "end": 852.54}, {"start": 853.44, "text": "好,那既然以前在window,", "end": 857.16}, {"start": 865.16, "text": "他们已经离开窗户啦,就可以说go的过去是啦。", "end": 869.16}, {"start": 878.97, "text": "这里又把主次的代词又帮大家复习了一遍。", "end": 882.97}, {"start": 883.87, "text": "所以我说什么,把这三十节连续看完,", "end": 886.87}, {"start": 886.87, "text": "你很多东西已经非常有余感啦,对不对?", "end": 890.87}, {"start": 890.87, "text": "千万不要又拿起本在那里。", "end": 892.87}, {"start": 893.5, "text": "你在这样的时候相当于在推卸责任给笔记本。", "end": 896.5}, {"start": 896.5, "text": "只要笔记本听懂了,我肯定也懂了。", "end": 899.5}, {"start": 899.5, "text": "这是不可能的。", "end": 901.5}, {"start": 901.0, "text": "She went with him, and he went with her.", "end": 904.18}, {"start": 904.18, "text": "Now, 现在, right?", "end": 906.18}, {"start": 906.18, "text": "They are at the door together.", "end": 909.98}, {"start": 909.98, "text": "Where are they? At the door together.", "end": 913.78}, {"start": 913.78, "text": "The boy is with...", "end": 915.78}, {"start": 915.41, "text": "是with the girl at the door。", "end": 918.41}, {"start": 918.41, "text": "Where are they? At the door。", "end": 920.41}, {"start": 920.41, "text": "They were at the window, now they are at the door。", "end": 925.41}, {"start": 925.41, "text": "She is at the door again。", "end": 928.41}, {"start": 928.41, "text": "这里又给大家一个新的词啦,是什么?", "end": 931.41}, {"start": 931.41, "text": "Again。", "end": 932.41}, {"start": 932.41, "text": "gain这个词是获得。", "end": 934.41}, {"start": 934.41, "text": "Again就是再获得、去获得这个动作。", "end": 938.41}, {"start": 938.41, "text": "所以当一个人再次达到一个目的或者状态的时候,我们就说again。", "end": 943.41}, {"start": 945.09, "text": "She is at the door again。", "end": 947.09}, {"start": 947.09, "text": "他又来到房间,他重新获得门口这个位置啦。", "end": 950.09}, {"start": 950.09, "text": "就可以这么理解。", "end": 952.09}, {"start": 952.09, "text": "She is at the door again。", "end": 954.09}, {"start": 954.09, "text": "Is the boy at the door again? No.", "end": 956.09}, {"start": 956.09, "text": "The boy was at the window.", "end": 958.09}, {"start": 958.09, "text": "He was not at the door.", "end": 960.09}, {"start": 960.09, "text": "So he is not at the door again。", "end": 963.09}, {"start": 963.09, "text": "有点绕,但是不难理解。", "end": 966.09}, {"start": 966.09, "text": "男生第一次到门,所以他不存在again。", "end": 970.2}, {"start": 970.2, "text": "只有女生she存在again的情况。", "end": 973.2}, {"start": 974.1, "text": "She is at the door again。", "end": 976.1}, {"start": 976.1, "text": "说到这连我都在好奇了,他们到底想干嘛。", "end": 979.1}, {"start": 979.1, "text": "Let's see。", "end": 980.1}, {"start": 980.1, "text": "在此之前,这本书有意思在哪里?", "end": 983.01}, {"start": 983.01, "text": "这些火柴人多多少少还有点事。", "end": 986.01}, {"start": 986.01, "text": "所以这些情节党的,你们越听越有感觉了。", "end": 990.01}, {"start": 990.01, "text": "而且这一次听情节你已经能听懂不少啦。", "end": 993.01}, {"start": 993.01, "text": "我们在这里进一步了解他们的行为之前,", "end": 997.01}, {"start": 997.01, "text": "先对刚刚以及上一节课的东西做一个快速回顾。", "end": 1001.01}, {"start": 1001.01, "text": "我要保证你们的吸收率。", "end": 1003.01}, {"start": 1003.91, "text": "So here we go。", "end": 1007.45}, {"start": 1007.45, "text": "This is a man,看得清吗?", "end": 1009.45}, {"start": 1009.45, "text": "He is a thing,还是He is a person?", "end": 1013.45}, {"start": 1013.45, "text": "刚学的两个概念,think跟person。", "end": 1016.45}, {"start": 1016.45, "text": "He is a person,是一个人。", "end": 1020.4}, {"start": 1020.4, "text": "This is a clock.", "end": 1023.21}, {"start": 1023.21, "text": "It is a clock,c-l-o-c-k。", "end": 1029.07}, {"start": 1029.07, "text": "o'clock,点钟,钟clock。", "end": 1032.07}, {"start": 1032.07, "text": "This is a clock.", "end": 1034.07}, {"start": 1034.07, "text": "It is a person,还是thing?", "end": 1037.07}, {"start": 1037.07, "text": "It's not a person.", "end": 1039.07}, {"start": 1039.97, "text": "It's a thing,它是一个东西。", "end": 1041.97}, {"start": 1041.97, "text": "This is a woman.", "end": 1043.97}, {"start": 1043.97, "text": "She is a person.", "end": 1046.97}, {"start": 1046.97, "text": "没问题吧。", "end": 1047.97}, {"start": 1047.97, "text": "我们加速一点啦。", "end": 1049.97}, {"start": 1049.97, "text": "This is a house.", "end": 1051.97}, {"start": 1051.97, "text": "It is a thing.", "end": 1055.66}, {"start": 1055.66, "text": "Very good。", "end": 1056.66}, {"start": 1056.66, "text": "我们这里反复又把person跟thing做了一次运用。", "end": 1060.66}, {"start": 1060.66, "text": "在过渡前,我们把拼写最后看一下。", "end": 1064.66}, {"start": 1064.66, "text": "clock,这个c很重,所以它是ck而不是k。", "end": 1070.13}, {"start": 1070.13, "text": "clock", "end": 1072.71}, {"start": 1073.61, "text": "thing", "end": 1075.94}, {"start": 1075.94, "text": "woman", "end": 1079.94}, {"start": 1079.94, "text": "person都是毕音节。", "end": 1083.94}, {"start": 1083.94, "text": "house", "end": 1085.94}, {"start": 1085.94, "text": "这里就是开音节啦,因为尾部还有一个原因。", "end": 1089.94}, {"start": 1089.94, "text": "尾巴有原因,前面就得开音节。", "end": 1091.94}, {"start": 1091.94, "text": "所以这个ou不能读w,应该是ow。", "end": 1097.94}, {"start": 1097.94, "text": "所以英国佬会讲什么?", "end": 1099.94}, {"start": 1099.94, "text": "It's a house,他们会这样去表house。", "end": 1104.56}, {"start": 1106.06, "text": "没有人会说house。", "end": 1108.06}, {"start": 1108.06, "text": "不会说着说,它会张着说。", "end": 1110.06}, {"start": 1110.06, "text": "thing, let's move on。", "end": 1112.06}, {"start": 1112.06, "text": "那么问题来了。", "end": 1114.06}, {"start": 1114.06, "text": "This is a girl, is she a person?", "end": 1116.58}, {"start": 1116.58, "text": "Is she a person or a thing?", "end": 1118.58}, {"start": 1118.58, "text": "What do you think?", "end": 1120.58}, {"start": 1120.58, "text": "What do you think?", "end": 1123.18}, {"start": 1123.18, "text": "You will put the answer here。", "end": 1125.18}, {"start": 1125.18, "text": "自己写看看,给大家5秒钟。", "end": 1128.89}, {"start": 1128.89, "text": "当然你要回答问题是什么?", "end": 1130.89}, {"start": 1130.89, "text": "Is she a person?", "end": 1133.54}, {"start": 1133.54, "text": "那你要怎么回答?", "end": 1136.3}, {"start": 1136.3, "text": "Yes, she is a person.", "end": 1138.3}, {"start": 1139.2, "text": "Is he a thing?", "end": 1142.52}, {"start": 1142.52, "text": "Put the answer here。5秒钟。", "end": 1148.7}, {"start": 1148.7, "text": "Is he a thing?", "end": 1151.16}, {"start": 1151.16, "text": "No, he is not a thing.", "end": 1153.16}, {"start": 1153.16, "text": "He is a person.", "end": 1155.66}, {"start": 1155.66, "text": "对吧,最完整的答案是这样。", "end": 1158.28}, {"start": 1158.28, "text": "当然你直接说no, he is a person。", "end": 1160.28}, {"start": 1160.28, "text": "也可以,省得啰嗦。", "end": 1162.28}, {"start": 1162.28, "text": "我们看一下拼写跟标准。", "end": 1164.28}, {"start": 1164.28, "text": "Yes, she is a person.", "end": 1166.28}, {"start": 1166.28, "text": "Is she a person?", "end": 1168.28}, {"start": 1168.28, "text": "Yes, she is a person.", "end": 1171.04}, {"start": 1171.04, "text": "Is he a thing?", "end": 1173.04}, {"start": 1173.04, "text": "No, he is a person.", "end": 1175.04}, {"start": 1176.59, "text": "你们有回答问题的能力了。", "end": 1178.59}, {"start": 1178.59, "text": "注意了。", "end": 1181.15}, {"start": 1181.15, "text": "单复数一直是英语里的一个语法重点。", "end": 1183.15}, {"start": 1183.15, "text": "我们说时态。", "end": 1185.15}, {"start": 1185.15, "text": "其实时态你们已经理解的很透了。", "end": 1187.15}, {"start": 1187.15, "text": "我觉得你们几个学生", "end": 1189.15}, {"start": 1189.15, "text": "已经把时态理顺了一个基础框架。", "end": 1191.15}, {"start": 1191.15, "text": "这里我们把复数", "end": 1193.15}, {"start": 1193.15, "text": "进行一次巩固。", "end": 1195.15}, {"start": 1195.15, "text": "因为英语有个特点是什么?", "end": 1197.15}, {"start": 1197.15, "text": "动一发,牵全身。", "end": 1199.15}, {"start": 1199.15, "text": "The boy is in the street.", "end": 1201.15}, {"start": 1201.15, "text": "The girl is in the house.", "end": 1203.15}, {"start": 1203.15, "text": "Boy在哪里? In the street.", "end": 1205.15}, {"start": 1205.15, "text": "Where is the girl? In the house.", "end": 1207.68}, {"start": 1207.68, "text": "They are not together.", "end": 1209.68}, {"start": 1209.68, "text": "他们在一起吗?", "end": 1211.68}, {"start": 1211.68, "text": "They are not together.", "end": 1213.68}, {"start": 1213.68, "text": "那秉承这个复数的are。", "end": 1215.68}, {"start": 1215.68, "text": "单数是什么?", "end": 1218.53}, {"start": 1218.53, "text": "Is。", "end": 1220.53}, {"start": 1220.53, "text": "我们尝试一下接下来的案例。", "end": 1222.53}, {"start": 1222.53, "text": "当然这里给了选项的,", "end": 1224.53}, {"start": 1224.53, "text": "所以是相当于一个选择题。", "end": 1227.41}, {"start": 1227.41, "text": "难度还没到,你们要完全自己写。", "end": 1229.41}, {"start": 1229.41, "text": "当然有能力自己写的可以尝试了。", "end": 1231.41}, {"start": 1231.41, "text": "Tom and Mary are together.", "end": 1234.06}, {"start": 1234.06, "text": "Mary什么? With Tom?", "end": 1236.06}, {"start": 1236.06, "text": "Is with Tom还是is not with Tom?", "end": 1238.06}, {"start": 1238.06, "text": "他说了什么? Are together.", "end": 1240.06}, {"start": 1240.06, "text": "Are together.", "end": 1242.06}, {"start": 1242.06, "text": "Are together.", "end": 1244.06}, {"start": 1244.06, "text": "So Mary is with Tom.", "end": 1246.06}, {"start": 1246.06, "text": "Yes, she is.", "end": 1248.06}, {"start": 1248.06, "text": "John is in his room.", "end": 1250.94}, {"start": 1250.94, "text": "Where is John? In his room.", "end": 1252.94}, {"start": 1252.94, "text": "Mary is at the door of the house.", "end": 1255.86}, {"start": 1255.86, "text": "John is in the room.", "end": 1257.86}, {"start": 1257.86, "text": "Mary is at the door.", "end": 1259.86}, {"start": 1259.86, "text": "John is with Mary", "end": 1262.9}, {"start": 1262.9, "text": "or is not with Mary?", "end": 1265.58}, {"start": 1265.58, "text": "Is not with Mary.", "end": 1268.08}, {"start": 1268.08, "text": "They are not together.", "end": 1270.08}, {"start": 1270.08, "text": "不在一起。", "end": 1272.08}, {"start": 1272.08, "text": "The boy went to the table.", "end": 1274.08}, {"start": 1274.08, "text": "The girl went to the table.", "end": 1276.08}, {"start": 1276.08, "text": "They are at the table together.", "end": 1278.08}, {"start": 1278.08, "text": "The bottle.", "end": 1280.08}, {"start": 1280.08, "text": "The bottle.", "end": 1282.08}, {"start": 1282.08, "text": "记得bottle吧。 A bottle of water.", "end": 1284.08}, {"start": 1284.08, "text": "bottle. 瓶子。", "end": 1286.99}, {"start": 1286.99, "text": "The bottle is on the table.", "end": 1288.99}, {"start": 1288.99, "text": "The glass is on the shelf.", "end": 1290.99}, {"start": 1290.99, "text": "The bottle is on the table.", "end": 1292.99}, {"start": 1292.99, "text": "The glass is on the shelf.", "end": 1294.99}, {"start": 1294.99, "text": "The bottle and the glass", "end": 1297.49}, {"start": 1297.49, "text": "The bottle and the glass", "end": 1299.49}, {"start": 1299.49, "text": "are not together on the table.", "end": 1301.49}, {"start": 1301.49, "text": "Are not together.", "end": 1303.49}, {"start": 1303.49, "text": "Because the glass is on the shelf.", "end": 1305.49}, {"start": 1305.49, "text": "来,最后一个。", "end": 1308.88}, {"start": 1308.88, "text": "Tom and Jane were in the street together.", "end": 1310.88}, {"start": 1310.88, "text": "Tom and Jane were in the street.", "end": 1312.88}, {"start": 1312.88, "text": "Tom was with Jane.", "end": 1314.88}, {"start": 1314.88, "text": "Jane was with Tom.", "end": 1317.92}, {"start": 1317.92, "text": "没问题吧。", "end": 1319.92}, {"start": 1319.92, "text": "他们在一起。", "end": 1321.92}, {"start": 1321.92, "text": "所以是什么?", "end": 1323.92}, {"start": 1323.92, "text": "Was with Jane, was with Tom.", "end": 1326.45}, {"start": 1326.45, "text": "因为干嘛?是过去在一起。", "end": 1328.45}, {"start": 1328.45, "text": "Were in the street together.", "end": 1330.45}, {"start": 1330.45, "text": "如果Tom and Jane are in the street together.", "end": 1332.45}, {"start": 1332.45, "text": "那就是什么?", "end": 1334.45}, {"start": 1334.45, "text": "Tom is with Jane.", "end": 1336.45}, {"start": 1336.45, "text": "Jane is with Tom.", "end": 1338.45}, {"start": 1338.45, "text": "那就是现在式的必来。", "end": 1340.45}, {"start": 1340.45, "text": "所以注意这种细节。", "end": 1342.45}, {"start": 1342.45, "text": "Introducing group members.", "end": 1344.45}, {"start": 1344.45, "text": "Group是什么?", "end": 1346.45}, {"start": 1346.45, "text": "就是一伙人。", "end": 1348.45}, {"start": 1348.45, "text": "我们经常去,你没有去过香港", "end": 1350.45}, {"start": 1350.45, "text": "上海,你去一些", "end": 1352.45}, {"start": 1352.45, "text": "大集团,对吧?", "end": 1354.45}, {"start": 1354.45, "text": "那个集团他们就会写", "end": 1356.45}, {"start": 1356.45, "text": "Tensen Group", "end": 1358.45}, {"start": 1358.45, "text": "Tensen Group", "end": 1360.45}, {"start": 1360.45, "text": "腾讯集团", "end": 1362.45}, {"start": 1362.45, "text": "就是一群个体组成的", "end": 1364.45}, {"start": 1364.45, "text": "就叫group。", "end": 1366.45}, {"start": 1366.45, "text": "在数学、物理、化学、生物", "end": 1368.45}, {"start": 1368.45, "text": "你都会看到group这个词。", "end": 1370.45}, {"start": 1370.45, "text": "那member是什么?", "end": 1372.45}, {"start": 1372.45, "text": "就是group里面的一员。", "end": 1374.45}, {"start": 1374.45, "text": "好,那我们要介绍", "end": 1376.45}, {"start": 1376.45, "text": "Introducing group members", "end": 1378.45}, {