nd": 1516.03}, {"start": 1516.03, "text": "解释一下", "end": 1518.59}, {"start": 1518.59, "text": "We painted trees and wrote tips", "end": 1520.59}, {"start": 1520.59, "text": "with colorful markers", "end": 1522.59}, {"start": 1522.59, "text": "This thing here", "end": 1524.59}, {"start": 1524.59, "text": "holding up the poster", "end": 1526.59}, {"start": 1526.59, "text": "什么意思呢?这个括号holding up the poster", "end": 1528.59}, {"start": 1528.59, "text": "是什么?Tom的动作", "end": 1531.09}, {"start": 1531.09, "text": "他是一个脱离文端的解释", "end": 1534.06}, {"start": 1534.06, "text": "所以叫brackets", "end": 1536.06}, {"start": 1536.06, "text": "书写规范", "end": 1538.06}, {"start": 1538.06, "text": "当你要做一个这种补充信息", "end": 1540.06}, {"start": 1540.06, "text": "又不能融入正文的时候", "end": 1542.06}, {"start": 1542.06, "text": "用括号", "end": 1544.06}, {"start": 1544.06, "text": "所以holding up the poster", "end": 1546.06}, {"start": 1546.06, "text": "Tom说什么?This thing here", "end": 1548.06}, {"start": 1548.06, "text": "is our final work", "end": 1550.06}, {"start": 1550.06, "text": "This is our", "end": 1552.06}, {"start": 1552.06, "text": "我们的什么work", "end": 1554.06}, {"start": 1554.06, "text": "我们的作品", "end": 1556.82}, {"start": 1556.82, "text": "We painted trees and wrote tips", "end": 1558.82}, {"start": 1558.82, "text": "with colorful markers", "end": 1560.82}, {"start": 1560.82, "text": "他们用这个color", "end": 1562.82}, {"start": 1562.82, "text": "是什么?颜色", "end": 1564.82}, {"start": 1564.82, "text": "painted trees", "end": 1566.82}, {"start": 1566.82, "text": "and wrote tips", "end": 1568.82}, {"start": 1568.82, "text": "tip就是什么?小建议", "end": 1570.82}, {"start": 1570.82, "text": "We had fun", "end": 1573.28}, {"start": 1573.28, "text": "很好玩right?", "end": 1575.28}, {"start": 1575.28, "text": "working together", "end": 1577.28}, {"start": 1577.28, "text": "有人就说了", "end": 1579.28}, {"start": 1579.28, "text": "这不是过去working together吗?", "end": 1581.28}, {"start": 1581.28, "text": "为什么是加ing", "end": 1583.28}, {