42, "text": "意思是什么?在当时", "end": 1658.42}, {"start": 1658.42, "text": "就在之前工作过", "end": 1660.42}, {"start": 1660.42, "text": "那就是过去的过去了", "end": 1662.42}, {"start": 1662.42, "text": "那是不是一句话,两个动词", "end": 1664.42}, {"start": 1664.42, "text": "两个过去时,就会变成过去的过去了", "end": 1666.42}, {"start": 1666.42, "text": "那就说不通了", "end": 1668.42}, {"start": 1668.42, "text": "所以主动词是had", "end": 1670.42}, {"start": 1670.42, "text": "就只能有一个动词是过去是", "end": 1672.42}, {"start": 1672.42, "text": "汉语同理", "end": 1674.42}, {"start": 1674.42, "text": "你们去想一下", "end": 1676.42}, {"start": 1676.42, "text": "Wonderful, it looks amazing", "end": 1678.42}, {"start": 1678.42, "text": "看起来太完美", "end": 1680.42}, {"start": 1680.42, "text": "老师都是这么说的", "end": 1682.42}, {"start": 1682.42, "text": "反正你教上来一坨,老师也是amazing", "end": 1684.42}, {"start": 1684.42, "text": "对吧,这就是我们", "end": 1686.42}, {"start": 1686.42, "text": "对学生的内趣历,包括在座的", "end": 1688.42}, {"start": 1688.42, "text": "各位内趣历的推动", "end": 1690.42}, {"start": 1690.42, "text": "这段话你能讲清楚", "end": 1692.42}, {"start": 1692.42, "text": "差不多也是雅思高考的作文", "end": 1694.42}, {"start": 1694.42, "text": "你能写清楚一段基本的", "end": 1696.42}, {"start": 1696.42, "text": "文字跟话,不犯错误", "end": 1698.42}, {"start": 1698.42, "text": "已经很牛逼了,就像我刚刚说的", "end": 1700.42}, {"start": 1700.42, "text": "We had fun working together", "end": 1702.42}, {"start": 1702.42, "text": "多少考生这个had跟working", "end": 1704.42}, {"start": 1704.42, "text": "就能搞错", "end": 1706.42}, {"start": 1706.42, "text": "所以不要小看任何基本课程", "end": 1708.42}, {"start": 1708.42, "text": "跟基本英语", "end": 1710.42}, {"start": 1710.42, "text": "那对于其他人", "end": 1712.42}, {"start": 1712.42, "text": "在座所有的邻居,包括考生", "end": 1714.42}, {"start": 1714.42, "text": "你能不能介绍一下", "end": 1716.42}, {"start": 1716.42, "text": "你的group members", "end": 1718.42}, {"start": 1718.42, "text": "在看完这段例子以后", "end": 1720.42}, {"start": 1720.42, "text": "我带着你们练习一遍", "end": 1723.2}, {"start": 1723.2, "text": "首先什么group members,我们先假设在座就是学生", "end": 1725.2}, {"start": 1725.2, "text": "自己学生有一群好朋友", "end": 1727.2}, {"start": 1727.2, "text": "闺蜜,兄弟", "end": 1729.2}, {"start": 1729.2, "text": "一起学的", "end": 1731.2}, {"start": 1731.2, "text": "那我们就假设他们也叫Tom,也叫Lily好了", "end": 1734.43}, {"start": 1734.43, "text": "I am a student,你先把主体明确一下", "end": 1736.43}, {"start": 1736.43, "text": "I am a student", "end": 1738.43}, {"start": 1738.43, "text": "We are students", "end": 1740.93}, {"start": 1740.93, "text": "We are a group", "end": 1742.93}, {"start": 1742.93, "text": "of students", "end": 1744.93}, {"start": 1744.93, "text": "我们是学生这个大群", "end": 1746.93}, {"start": 1746.93, "text": "大群体中的", "end": 1748.93}, {"start": 1748.93, "text": "一个团队,说明什么", "end": 1750.93}, {"start": 1750.93, "text": "一个母籍里的一个子籍", "end": 1752.93}, {"start": 1752.93, "text": "所以是of", "end": 1754.93}, {"start": 1754.93, "text": "We are a group of students", "end": 1756.93}, {"start": 1756.93, "text": "Our teacher is teacher Eric", "end": 1758.93}, {"start": 1758.93, "text": "我们的老师是谁", "end": 1760.93}, {"start": 1760.93, "text": "is teacher Eric,此刻也是Eric", "end": 1762.93}, {"start": 1762.93, "text": "所以is teacher Eric", "end": 1764.93}, {"start": 1764.93, "text": "In our group", "end": 1766.93}, {"start": 1766.93, "text": "在我们的团队里", "end": 1768.93}, {"start": 1768.93, "text": "There are", "end": 1770.93}, {"start": 1770.93, "text": "那里有什么", "end": 1772.93}, {"start": 1772.93, "text": "There are three people", "end": 1774.93}, {"start": 1774.93, "text": "Me, Lily and Tom", "end": 1776.93}, {"start": 1776.93, "text": "这个团队有几个人", "end": 1778.93}, {"start": 1778.93, "text": "There are three people", "end": 1780.93}, {"start": 1780.93, "text": "Me, Lily and Tom", "end": 1782.93}, {"start": 1782.93, "text": "We love", "end": 1785.65}, {"start": 1785.65, "text": "我们超爱teacher Eric", "end": 1787.65}, {"start": 1787.65, "text": "We love teacher Eric", "end": 1789.65}, {"start": 1789.65, "text": "Teacher Eric is awesome", "end": 1791.65}, {"start": 1791.65, "text": "Amazing", "end": 1795.66}, {"start": 1795.66, "text": "Great, wonderful", "end": 1798.22}, {"start": 1798.22, "text": "Amazing", "end": 1801.5}, {"start": 1801.5, "text": "这些常用的形容词是不是可以堆进去", "end": 1803.5}, {"start": 1803.5, "text": "很多人就是常用几个词", "end": 1805.5}, {"start": 1805.5, "text": "每次写作文就是那几个词", "end": 1807.5}, {"start": 1807.5, "text": "一起抛出去用", "end": 1809.5}, {"start": 1809.5, "text": "这就是我们说的模板", "end": 1811.5}, {"start": 1811.5, "text": "在这个时候你们确实可以用一些常用词", "end": 1813.5}, {"start": 1813.5, "text": "也去巩固一下", "end": 1815.5}, {"start": 1815.5, "text": "这段话讲到这里其实已经很完整了", "end": 1817.5}, {"start": 1817.5, "text": "你把你的introducing group member做到了", "end": 1819.5}, {"start": 1819.5, "text": "在这个基础上你还想", "end": 1821.5}, {"start": 1821.5, "text": "补充什么信息呢", "end": 1823.5}, {"start": 1823.5, "text": "我们就说一句收尾", "end": 1825.5}, {"start": 1825.5, "text": "We'll try hard", "end": 1827.5}, {"start": 1827.5, "text": "我们要干嘛", "end": 1829.5}, {"start": 1829.5, "text": "Try hard", "end": 1831.5}, {"start": 1831.5, "text": "尝试", "end": 1833.5}, {"start": 1833.5, "text": "尝试努力的干嘛", "end": 1835.5}, {"start": 1835.5, "text": "To 从A到B", "end": 1837.5}, {"start": 1837.5, "text": "To 学英语", "end": 1840.16}, {"start": 1840.16, "text": "Thank you", "end": 1842.16}, {"start": 1842.16, "text": "最后跟观众说什么谢谢你们听我讲话", "end": 1844.16}, {"start": 1844.16, "text": "Thank you", "end": 1847.12}, {"start": 1847.12, "text": "英语没有复杂之说", "end": 1849.12}, {"start": 1849.12, "text": "你能把一个简单的事讲清楚", "end": 1851.12}, {"start": 1851.12, "text": "你已经超过90%的人了", "end": 1853.12}, {"start": 1853.12, "text": "如果基础英语稀烂", "end": 1855.62}, {"start": 1855.62, "text": "就是高考生", "end": 1857.62}, {"start": 1857.62, "text": "这些东西一段话下来", "end": 1859.62}, {"start": 1859.62, "text": "错误百出", "end": 1861.62}, {"start": 1861.62, "text": "你无法去概括有几种错误", "end": 1863.62}, {"start": 1863.62, "text": "很多是小学就接触过的语言", "end": 1865.62}, {"start": 1865.62, "text": "错到高中", "end": 1867.62}, {"start": 1867.62, "text": "不要小看任何一节课的任何一个概念", "end": 1869.62}, {"start": 1869.62, "text": "你去多用几次", "end": 1871.62}, {"start": 1871.62, "text": "巩固下来你就超过很多人了", "end": 1873.62}, {"start": 1873.62, "text": "记住80%的英语", "end": 1875.62}, {"start": 1875.62, "text": "雅诗也好高考也好", "end": 1877.62}, {"start": 1877.62, "text": "都是基本功", "end": 1879.62}, {"start": 1879.62, "text": "Thank you for being part of our", "end": 1881.62}, {"start": 1881.62, "text": "12th lesson", "end": 1883.62}, {"start": 1883.62, "text": "Thank you for listening", "end": 1885.62}, {"start": 1885.62, "text": "I will see you in lesson 13", "end": 1887.62}, {"start": 1887.62, "text": "Goodbye", "end": 1889.62}]}